Written by hand for this repository on 2026-11-10 (the Update spec's
fixture, section 9.4), no third-party content but KiCad's Device:R as the
unnumbered fixture carries it and a plain Device:LED drawn here: a one-sheet
schematic with R1 (1k, Resistor_SMD:R_0603_1608Metric) and D1 (Red,
LED_SMD:LED_0603_1608Metric) in series, R1 pin 1 on the global label VIN, R1
pin 2 wired to D1's anode, D1's cathode on the global label GND; an empty
two-layer board with a 30 by 20 mm Edge.Cuts outline; the project file. The
e2e makes its variants at test time (R1 as "R?", the board alone). The KiCad
files carry no comment (their formats have none), so this file holds their
license.
